{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22965","headline":"闻李尚书拜相因以长句寄贺微之 · 白居易","name":"闻李尚书拜相因以长句寄贺微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君不久在通川，知已新提造化权。\n夔卨定求才济世，张雷应辨气冲天。\n那知沦落天涯日，正是陶钧海内年。\n肯向泥中抛折劒，不收重铸作龙泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}